---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Get in touch with DeskKaki."><article>
<h1>Contact</h1>
<p>Questions, corrections, or a product you'd like us to look into? Email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. We read everything and usually reply within a few working days.</p>
<p>Brands and PR: we're happy to hear about new products sold in Singapore, but we don't accept payment for coverage.</p>
</article></Base>
